# --- Mission 01: Ferrostorm Rising - wipe out the raider camp ---
# P7-9a: the yard and the opening treasury are declared HERE, not in a
# per-mission case in the client. Missions 04 to 06 have always done this;
# 01 and 03 got theirs from `switch (setup.MissionIndex)` in SkirmishLive,
# which is a rule keyed on WHICH mission this is rather than on what the
# mission says, so every new mission needed a C# edit and a matching one in
# the gate, and a mission whose author forgot was silently a mission with no
# base. Two mechanisms for one thing is the duplication this phase keeps
# finding; this is the second one retired.
structure 0 4 6 22
trigger elapsed 0 -> grant 0 5000
# Player forces
unit 0 1 12 20
unit 0 1 12 24
unit 0 2 10 22
unit 0 2 10 24
# Raider camp (tag: camp) behind the ridge
structure 1 1 44 18 camp
structure 1 2 48 20 camp
structure 1 5 42 22 camp
# Q012 fork 3: these two squads are UNTAGGED deliberately. Elimination and a
# scripted objective are BOTH legitimate wins, and elimination fires when the
# last camp STRUCTURE dies - so a tag that also demanded the squads described a
# condition that could never decide the mission.
unit 1 2 44 24
unit 1 2 46 24
# Objectives and scripting
trigger elapsed 150 -> message reinforcements_inbound
trigger elapsed 150 -> grant 0 2000
trigger entered 0 40 24 8 -> spawn 1 2 50 28 3
trigger entered 0 40 24 8 -> message ambush_sprung
trigger destroyed camp -> win 0
